EyesWebTD @EyesWebTD_CHOP_VERSION@

Built for: @EW_TD_BUILT_FOR@
The operators need a TouchDesigner whose C++ CHOP API is the one above or newer (the plugin refuses to load otherwise).

Install: copy the DLLs of the Plugins folder into the Plugins folder of your project, or into
%USERPROFILE%\Documents\Derivative\Plugins (directly, not in subfolders: TouchDesigner does not load those), then restart
TouchDesigner. The operators appear in the OP Create dialog
(Custom tab) with the labels "EW L1 ...", "EW L2 ...", "EW L3 ...", "EW L4 ...", "EW AP ...".
The palette builder (palette\build_palette.py) is described in palette\README.md.
